.TH tokenizer_read_until 3
.SH NAME
tokenizer_read_until \- read input until marker
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "tokenizer.h"
.PP
.BI "int tokenizer_read_until(tokenizer *" t ", const char *" marker ", int " stop_at_nl ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tokenizer_read_until
reads characters from the input stream until the specified
.I marker
is encountered. If
.I stop_at_nl
is non-zero, it also stops reading at newlines. The consumed text is stored in the tokenizer's buffer.